<p>ENDING	BARROWS &amp; GILTS	SOWS		STAGS &amp; BOARS</p>
<p>30-Nov-96	 96.4%		2.9%			 0.6%</p>
<p>02-Dec-95	 95.6%		3.7%			 0.8%</p>
